# ranking-records: power-on, the title (Start, Start), the mode select: Right (Puzzle), Cross,
# Cross. Puzzle Mode starts on tick 2678 with player 2 idle (screen 8); a poke puts player 1 on
# screen 8 too, so Puzzle Mode names RANKING.EXE (param 0) as when both players quit. Pokes on
# the same tick fill both ranking tables with edge cases (blank letters, 7- and 8-digit scores,
# zero, zone 5's 100-stage entry with no stage, stage bytes past 19 and 0xFF). The tables slide
# in; during the 300-tick wait pad 2 holds Start + Select: after 121 ticks the soft reset names
